#: src/anduinos-appearance:344
msgid "Simple Weather"
msgstr "简易天气"

msgid "Update approximate weather location"
msgstr "更新天气的大致位置"

msgid "Weather Services Privacy Agreement"
msgstr "天气服务隐私许可协议"

msgid ""
"1. Approximate location (ipapi.co)\n"
"AnduinOS will make one HTTPS request to ipapi.co. Its operator, Kloudend, Inc., will see your public IP address and may use it to estimate your city, country, and approximate coordinates.\n"
"\n"
"2. Weather data (Open-Meteo)\n"
"The weather extension will send the selected approximate coordinates to Open-Meteo, operated by OpenMeteo GmbH. The service will also see your public IP address and may retain API logs for up to 90 days.\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by either third-party service. If location detection fails, AnduinOS will use an offline estimate based on your system timezone.\n"
"\n"
"Privacy policies:\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"
msgstr ""
"1. 大致位置（ipapi.co）\n"
"AnduinOS 将向 ipapi.co 发起一次 HTTPS 请求。其运营方 Kloudend, Inc. 将能看到您的公网 IP 地址，并可能使用它来估算您的城市、国家和大致经纬度。\n"
"\n"
"2. 天气数据（Open-Meteo）\n"
"天气扩展会将所选的大致经纬度发送给由 OpenMeteo GmbH 运营的 Open-Meteo。该服务也将看到您的公网 IP 地址，并可能将 API 日志保留最长 90 天。\n"
"\n"
"AnduinOS 与上述任何第三方服务均无隶属、赞助或背书关系。如果定位失败，AnduinOS 将使用根据系统时区生成的离线估算位置。\n"
"\n"
"隐私政策：\n"
"https://ipapi.co/privacy/\n"
"https://open-meteo.com/en/terms"

msgid "Decline"
msgstr "拒绝"

msgid "Agree to All"
msgstr "同意全部"

msgid "Weather was not enabled because permission was declined."
msgstr "由于您拒绝了许可，天气功能未启用。"

msgid "Failed to save weather permission."
msgstr "无法保存天气服务许可。"

msgid "Determining your approximate location…"
msgstr "正在确定您的大致位置…"

msgid "Failed to configure the weather extension."
msgstr "无法配置天气扩展。"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Weather location set to {location}."
msgstr "天气位置已设为 {location}。"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Location service unavailable; using {location} from your timezone."
msgstr "定位服务不可用；正在使用根据您所在时区推测的 {location}。"

msgid "Weather was disabled, but its saved permission could not be cleared."
msgstr "天气功能已关闭，但无法清除已保存的许可。"

